      "writtenOn": "2017-03-24T03:23:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think clearBssidBlacklist() is sufficient here.  You actually want to overwrite the firmware - even if the local copy of the list is empty.  If you are just starting up but there was something left over in firmware, you won\u0027t overwrite it.  It would be good to use that other call we put in where you call with null (or was it empty lists?) and it overwrites/resets the firmware.",
      "range": {
