      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-03-24T03:41:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Then what about go back to the original implementation such that clearBssidBlacklist() always clears the WCM mBssidBlacklist and firmware one? Basically remove the mBssidBlacklist.isEmpty() check. We may waste a mBssidBlacklist.clear() operation, but logic wise it is more straight forward and we always do the same operation to the WCM blacklist and the firmware blacklist.",
      "parentUuid": "ddffa8a6_53ad4d33",
      "range": {
