      "writtenOn": "2017-03-24T05:07:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I still think the clear is the common case - so we shouldn\u0027t keep writing to firmware if it isn\u0027t needed.  we do have the ability to reset the firmware - we put that in the call for the helper.  The other reason I think we should do this is if you end up implementing a reason-based clear to avoid losing the assoc rejections, then you will not want to use that for this general purpose clear.",
