      "writtenOn": "2017-03-26T05:36:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Basically my take is that we just need one type of clear. Today it is simply a full clear. Later it will be improved (TODO: b/36562862) and become a reason based clearing. We don\u0027t need both.",
